  "content": "<div>\n  <h1>可重生寵物</h1>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/strawberrylib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/ContentSMP/Badges/raw/refs/heads/main/strawberrylib/cozy_vector.svg\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Am6M8VQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmoriyashiine\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\"></a>\n  <h3>透過新物品「乙太寶石」，讓你的寵物在死亡後能於下次睡眠時重生。</h3>\n</div><p>透過與寵物互動【使用物品/放置方塊】來切換重生狀態。你也可以在9x3x9區域內潛行使用乙太寶石，同時設定多隻寵物重生。乙太寶石僅對你擁有的寵物有效，且排除在<code>respawnablepets:cannot_respawn</code>標籤中的實體。</p><p><strong>合成配方</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/MoriyaShiine/respawnable-pets/blob/main/.webassets/recipe.png?raw=true\" alt=\"合成配方\"></p>",
